@inherits ProjectsContent

<div class="content @(Idx == idxCounter ? "contentActive" : "")">
    @{
        idxCounter++;
    }
    <div>
        <h2>
            SmartERP – Modern Enterprise Resource Planning System.
        </h2>

        <div>
            🚀 <strong>Project Overview</strong>
        </div>

        <div class="ms-2">
            SmartERP is a modern full-stack ERP system designed for small and medium businesses.<br />
            It provides a complete solution for managing business operations in a clean, fast, and scalable way.<br /><br />

            The system helps companies manage:<br />
            • Inventory<br />
            • Sales<br />
            • Purchases<br />
            • Customers<br />
            • Suppliers<br />
            • Employees<br />
            • Financial transactions<br />
            • Reports and dashboards<br />
            • Roles and permissions<br /><br />

            The system focuses heavily on:<br />
            • Clean Architecture<br />
            • Maintainable and scalable code<br />
            • High performance<br />
            • Real-world business logic<br />
            • Excellent UI/UX experience<br />
        </div>
    </div>
</div>


<div class="content @(Idx == idxCounter ? "contentActive" : "")">
    @{
        idxCounter++;
    }
    <div>
        <h2>SmartERP – Tech Stack</h2>

        <div>
            ⚙️ <strong>Frontend</strong>
        </div>

        <div class="ms-2">
            React + TypeScript<br />
            React Router<br />
            Redux Toolkit / Context API<br />
            Tailwind CSS<br />
            Shadcn/UI Components<br />
            React Hook Form + Zod Validation<br />
            Axios (API handling)<br />
            Recharts (Analytics dashboards)<br />
            Framer Motion (Animations)<br />
        </div>

        <br />

        <div>
            🧠 <strong>Backend</strong>
        </div>

        <div class="ms-2">
            ASP.NET Core Web API (.NET 8)<br />
            Clean Architecture<br />
            CQRS + MediatR<br />
            Entity Framework Core<br />
            SQL Server<br />
            FluentValidation<br />
            JWT Authentication + Refresh Tokens<br />
            Serilog Logging<br />
            AutoMapper<br />
            Repository + Unit of Work Pattern<br />
        </div>
    </div>
</div>


<div class="content @(Idx == idxCounter ? "contentActive" : "")">
    @{
        idxCounter++;
    }
    <div>
        <h2>SmartERP – Architecture Overview</h2>

        <div>
            🏗️ <strong>Backend Layers</strong>
        </div>

        <div class="ms-2">

            <strong>1. Domain Layer</strong><br />
            • Entities<br />
            • Value Objects<br />
            • Enums<br />
            • Domain Events<br />
            • Interfaces<br />
            → No external dependencies<br /><br />

            <strong>2. Application Layer</strong><br />
            • CQRS Commands & Queries<br />
            • DTOs<br />
            • Validators (FluentValidation)<br />
            • MediatR Handlers<br />
            • Business Rules<br />
            → Organized by Features (Products, Sales, Inventory)<br /><br />

            <strong>3. Infrastructure Layer</strong><br />
            • EF Core Configuration<br />
            • Repositories<br />
            • Authentication Services<br />
            • Logging (Serilog)<br />
            • Email / File Services<br /><br />

            <strong>4. Presentation Layer</strong><br />
            • ASP.NET Core Controllers<br />
            • Thin controllers only<br />
            • All logic handled via MediatR<br />
        </div>
    </div>
</div>


<div class="content @(Idx == idxCounter ? "contentActive" : "")">
    @{
        idxCounter++;
    }
    <div>
        <h2>SmartERP – Core Modules</h2>

        <div class="ms-2">
            <strong>Authentication & Authorization</strong><br />
            • JWT Authentication<br />
            • Refresh Tokens<br />
            • Role & Permission System<br />
            • Admin / Manager / Accountant / Cashier / Warehouse roles<br /><br />

            <strong>Dashboard</strong><br />
            • Revenue analytics<br />
            • Sales charts<br />
            • Low stock alerts<br />
            • Top products<br />
            • Recent invoices<br /><br />

            <strong>Product & Inventory</strong><br />
            • Product CRUD<br />
            • Categories<br />
            • Stock tracking<br />
            • Automatic stock updates<br />
            • Prevent negative stock<br /><br />

            <strong>Sales Module</strong><br />
            • Invoice creation<br />
            • Discounts & taxes<br />
            • PDF export<br />
            • Stock validation<br /><br />

            <strong>Purchases</strong><br />
            • Supplier invoices<br />
            • Stock increase automation<br /><br />

            <strong>Financial Module</strong><br />
            • Expenses & revenue tracking<br />
            • Cash transactions<br />
            • Daily reports<br /><br />

            <strong>Reports</strong><br />
            • Sales reports<br />
            • Profit analysis<br />
            • Inventory reports<br />
            • Exportable filters<br />
        </div>
    </div>
</div>


<div class="content @(Idx == idxCounter ? "contentActive" : "")">
    @{
        idxCounter++;
    }
    <div>
        <h2>SmartERP – UI/UX Vision</h2>

        <div class="ms-2">
            The system is designed to feel like a modern SaaS product similar to Stripe, Notion, and Odoo.<br /><br />

            UI principles:<br />
            • Minimal and clean design<br />
            • Fast navigation (2–3 clicks max per action)<br />
            • Responsive layout (mobile + desktop)<br />
            • Dark / Light mode support<br />
            • Smooth animations (Framer Motion)<br />
            • Modern dashboards with charts<br />
            • Clear typography and spacing<br />
            • Empty states + loading skeletons<br /><br />

            UX goals:<br />
            • Simple for non-technical users<br />
            • Fast invoice creation<br />
            • Easy search (products/customers)<br />
            • No clutter or complexity<br />
        </div>
    </div>
</div>


<div class="content @(Idx == idxCounter ? "contentActive" : "")">
    @{
        idxCounter++;
    }
    <div>
        <h2>SmartERP – Engineering & Performance</h2>

        <div class="ms-2">
            • Clean Architecture (strict separation of concerns)<br />
            • CQRS with MediatR for scalability<br />
            • FluentValidation for request validation<br />
            • Serilog for logging errors and actions<br />
            • Global exception handling middleware<br />
            • Pagination, filtering, sorting everywhere<br />
            • AsNoTracking for read performance<br />
            • Proper indexing on SQL Server<br />
            • Soft delete strategy for safe data handling<br /><br />

            Security:<br />
            • JWT Authentication<br />
            • Role-based + Permission-based access<br />
            • Secure password hashing<br />
            • Refresh token rotation<br /><br />

            Performance:<br />
            • Optimized EF Core queries<br />
            • Avoid unnecessary loading<br />
            • Efficient database structure<br />
        </div>
    </div>
</div>


